title: 'pallet-vesting: add try_state invariant checks'

doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Adds a `try_state` hook to `pallet-vesting` (issue #239) that asserts every stored account has a non empty list of vesting schedules and that each stored schedule is valid. The vesting lock is intentionally not checked against the schedules, since `LockableCurrency` exposes no way to read the current lock amount. The checks run under the `try-runtime` feature, and also after every unit test. The change is additive with no migration or weight changes.

crates:
- name: pallet-vesting
  bump: minor
